y so desire), so they are in restrictions and GM Notes and not in equipment_starting. || EQUIPMENT readings: pocket-size CD audio recorder is the PDD recorder/player row; mechanic''s tool kit is the generic tool-kit row; several IRMSS is one row with no number printed; the compu-drug dispenser is printed in both the medical kit and the surgical kit and stored as two; the stethoscope and the digital stethoscope are two of the one stethoscope row; the laser scalpel in the surgical kit and the additional one are two; silver dagger is knife-silver-plated; light body armor is the generic light-mdc-body-armor row; standard uniforms are the uniform row. Kit contents that the medical-kit and surgical-kit rows stand for are in the notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: the medical harness with its many pouches; two dozen throw-away paper surgical gowns; the 12 three hour discs; the hand-held computerized blood pressure machine; six unbreakable specimen containers; 100 pairs of disposable surgical gloves (the catalog row is priced per box, quantity unclear); an energy rifle of choice and an energy pistol sidearm; a handful of personal items."
